flowchart LR
    accTitle: Common-source agreement is not corroboration
    accDescr: Source record S01 version 1 is the single parent of two model inferences, M01 from Agent A and M02 from Agent B, and both feed decision packet P01 version 1. Their agreement is common origin, not independent corroboration. A conflicting source record S02 version 1 also reaches the packet. Dashed arrows are typed relationships, not ancestry: S02 contradicts S01, correction S01 version 2 supersedes S01 version 1 and invalidates M01 and M02, and a scoped validation V01 assesses only S01 version 1.
    S01["<b>S01/v1</b><br/>source record"]:::src
    subgraph D["Derived from S01/v1: one origin"]
        direction TB
        M01["<b>M01/v1</b> model inference<br/>Agent A"]:::inf
        M02["<b>M02/v1</b> model inference<br/>Agent B"]:::inf
    end
    P01["<b>P01/v1</b><br/>decision packet<br/>the conflict stays visible"]:::pkt
    S02["<b>S02/v1</b><br/>source record<br/>conflicting assertion"]:::warn
    S01b["<b>S01/v2</b><br/>correction"]:::src
    V01["<b>V01/v1</b><br/>scoped validation<br/>of S01/v1 only"]:::plain
    S01 --> M01
    S01 --> M02
    M01 --> P01
    M02 --> P01
    S02 --> P01
    S02 -. "contradiction" .- S01
    S01b -. "supersession" .-> S01
    S01b -. "invalidation" .-> D
    V01 -. "validation" .-> S01
